OL,3,GNEWSAFormer PM Truss calls for fracking
OL,4,Ain Lincolnshire
OL,5,
OL,6,FFormer Prime Minister Liz Truss has
OL,7,Fcalled for fracking to be introduced in
OL,8,FLincolnshire claiming the county "is
OL,9,Fone of the best places to exploit our
OL,10,Fenergy reserves".
OL,12,FTruss was speaking at the Great
OL,13,FExhibition event at the Lincolnshire
OL,14,FShowground, which is being hosted by
OL,15,Fthe county's elected mayor Dame Andrea
OL,16,FJenkyns.
OL,23,APub: 23-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBYrk Lincs NewsCReg TVFWeather
FL,386,380,200,160,0,100
