OL,3,GNEWSAFormer PM Truss calls for fracking
OL,4,Ain Lincolnshire
OL,5,
OL,6,FFracking, which involves drilling into
OL,7,Fthe earth and directing a high-pressure
OL,8,Fmixture of water, sand and chemicals at
OL,9,Frock to release the gas inside, is
OL,10,Fcurrently paused in the UK and the
OL,11,Fgovernment is considering a permanent
OL,12,Fban.
OL,14,FConservative politician Truss said that
OL,15,F"Lincolnshire has a huge shale gas
OL,16,Fopportunity."
